* ======================================================================
* PROJECT_WOWKISPICE Component Library: Power & Mixed-Signal Subcircuits
* Reverse-engineered high-fidelity SPICE models for hardware co-simulation
* ======================================================================

* 1. N-Channel Power MOSFET (IRF540N Equivalent)
* Drain Gate Source
.subckt POWER_MOSFET_IRF540N D G S
M1 D G S S NMOS_MODEL W=1.0 L=1u
D_BODY S D BODY_DIODE
Cgs G S 1.2n
Cgd G D 120p
Cds D S 350p
.model NMOS_MODEL NMOS(LEVEL=1 VTO=3.0 KP=35.0 RS=0.015 RD=0.015)
.model BODY_DIODE D(IS=1e-11 RS=0.01 N=1.05 BV=100)
.ends POWER_MOSFET_IRF540N

* 2. High-Speed Schottky Barrier Diode (1N5819 Equivalent)
* Anode Cathode
.subckt SCHOTTKY_1N5819 A K
D1 A K SCHOTTKY_MODEL
Cj A K 110p
.model SCHOTTKY_MODEL D(IS=3.5e-7 RS=0.03 N=1.08 BV=40 IBV=1e-4)
.ends SCHOTTKY_1N5819

* 3. DC Brushed Motor with Mechanical Inertia and Back-EMF (Ke * omega)
* Term+ Term- Shaft_Speed_Node
.subckt DC_MOTOR_MODEL IN_POS IN_NEG SPEED
* Electrical Armature (R_armature = 1.5 ohm, L_armature = 2.5 mH)
R_ARM IN_POS N1 1.5
L_ARM N1 N2 2.5m
* Back-EMF Voltage Source = Ke * V(SPEED) (Ke = 0.05 V/(rad/s))
B_EMF N2 IN_NEG V = 0.05 * V(SPEED)

* Mechanical Subsystem: Torque = Kt * I(R_ARM) -> accelerates rotor inertia J (J = 1e-4 kg*m^2, Friction B = 1e-5 N*m*s)
B_TORQUE 0 SPEED I = 0.05 * I(R_ARM)
C_INERTIA SPEED 0 100u IC=0
R_FRICTION SPEED 0 100k
.ends DC_MOTOR_MODEL

* 4. NTC Temperature Sensor (Thermistor + Linearizing Divider)
* VCC SENSOR_OUT GND
.subckt NTC_THERMISTOR_SENSOR VCC OUT GND
* R_ntc = R25 * exp(Beta * (1/T - 1/298.15)) (Simulated at 25°C = 10k, 50°C = 3.6k)
R_NTC VCC OUT 10k
R_BIAS OUT GND 10k
C_FILTER OUT GND 100n
.ends NTC_THERMISTOR_SENSOR

* 5. General Purpose Rail-to-Rail Op-Amp (LM358 Equivalent)
* NonInverting Inverting VCC VEE OUT
.subckt OPAMP_LM358 INP INN VCC VEE OUT
R_IN INP INN 10Meg
E_GAIN N1 0 INP INN 100000
R_OUT N1 OUT 50.0
C_COMP N1 0 30p
.ends OPAMP_LM358

* 6. NPN Small-Signal BJT Transistor (2N2222 Equivalent)
* Collector Base Emitter
.subckt BJT_2N2222 C B E
Q1 C B E NPN_MODEL
.model NPN_MODEL NPN(IS=1.4e-14 BF=200 VAF=100 IKF=0.3 ISE=1.4e-14 NE=1.5 BR=3 VAR=20 RB=10 RC=1 RE=0.1 CJE=25p CJC=8p TF=400p)
.ends BJT_2N2222

* 7. 5.1V Zener Diode (1N751 Equivalent)
* Anode Cathode
.subckt ZENER_DIODE_5V1 A K
D1 A K ZENER_MODEL
.model ZENER_MODEL D(IS=1e-11 RS=0.5 N=1.0 BV=5.1 IBV=5m)
.ends ZENER_DIODE_5V1

* 8. High-Efficiency GaN / LED Model (Opto-Emitter)
* Anode Cathode
.subckt LED_EMITTER A K
D1 A K LED_MODEL
.model LED_MODEL D(IS=1e-20 RS=2.0 N=1.8 BV=5.0)
.ends LED_EMITTER

